      "story": {
        "title": "The Counting Race",
        "paras": [
          "Five ducks walk to the pond. Uno, dos, tres, cuatro, cinco. They love to swim!",
          "Three more ducks come. Seis, siete, ocho. Now there are ocho ducks in total!",
          "Then two more arrive. Nueve, diez! '¡Diez!' shout all the ducks. It's a duck party!"
        ],
        "qs": [
